From 606ac7fb5c79f0a97752e809c9d55b0961f906a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:18:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 105/105] fix(admin): the app build is counted on every
 signed-in route (4298, box 51104)

The device and build were recorded only by /threads and /contacts, so a
request with X-App-Build elsewhere never reached device_fingerprints. The
recording now runs once, app-wide, before the routers: it reads the user
token itself, needs X-Device-Id as before, and writes each device at most
once a minute per build (a new build is written at once).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
